the format AudioFormatDescription{type: PCM, pcm: INT_16_BIT, encoding: } by the port 15\n```\n\nI\u0027m looking at working out how to fix the DD+JOC loopback without breaking the routing tests, but there seems to be issues with the behaviour of the device during the routing tests already.",
